new

domain extent -10.0 10.0

; generate balls
set random 10001 ; set the seed of the random number generator to ensure repeatability

ball generate ...
     group ballgroup1 ...
     radius 0.05 0.05 ...
     box -9.0 -1.0 -9.0 9.0 ...
     cubic ...
     id 1 500 ...
     tries 10000

ball generate ...
     group ballgroup2 ...
     radius 1.0 1.5 ...
     box 1.0  9.0 -9.0 9.0 ...
     hexagonal ...
     id 100000 ...
     number 100 ...
     tries 1000

;关键词cubic和hexagonal均不能与关键词gauss共存
;采用关键词cubic或hexagonal后，关键词id、number和tries均不再起作用，生成颗粒个数自动计算

cmat default model linear property kn 1e6 proximity 0.0

clean